{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13208390922613358776,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll Internals",
      "source_hash": 3015964940201308803,
      "context_hash": 517455495227668808,
      "translation": "epoll 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How epoll monitors thousands of file descriptors efficiently",
      "source_hash": 6755299439075945738,
      "context_hash": 17306035997873160704,
      "translation": "epoll이 수천 개의 파일 디스크립터를 효율적으로 감시하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll",
        "file descriptors": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem with poll/select",
      "source_hash": 4991653717392841952,
      "context_hash": 1590079193194473470,
      "translation": "poll/select의 문제점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`select()` and `poll()` require passing the entire set of monitored file descriptors on every call.",
      "source_hash": 10819353089835180145,
      "context_hash": 356301886839354654,
      "translation": "`select()`와 `poll()`은 호출할 때마다 감시 대상 파일 디스크립터 전체 집합을 전달해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptors": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For N fds:",
      "source_hash": 6157646136182891453,
      "context_hash": 3114410533493637625,
      "translation": "N개의 fd에 대해:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Userspace → kernel copy: O(N)",
      "source_hash": 371043029093324706,
      "context_hash": 10644081397886705329,
      "translation": "사용자 공간 → 커널 복사: O(N)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel scans all fds for readiness: O(N)",
      "source_hash": 15723012806501974100,
      "context_hash": 4339195686367393033,
      "translation": "커널이 모든 fd의 준비 상태를 검사: O(N)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel → userspace copy of ready fds: O(N)",
      "source_hash": 15648775212715518228,
      "context_hash": 4822021443826891901,
      "translation": "준비된 fd의 커널 → 사용자 공간 복사: O(N)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Total per-call: O(N), even if only 1 fd is ready",
      "source_hash": 9094816733332475156,
      "context_hash": 2393688961923164953,
      "translation": "호출당 총비용: 준비된 fd가 1개뿐이어도 O(N)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "With 10,000 connections this is unacceptable.",
      "source_hash": 5347303030739870819,
      "context_hash": 8143831911655461339,
      "translation": "연결이 10,000개라면 이는 받아들일 수 없는 수준입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll: O(1) per event",
      "source_hash": 15360385949188118514,
      "context_hash": 8075846312921346639,
      "translation": "epoll: 이벤트당 O(1)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll uses a **kernel-resident interest list** — registered once, no re-copying:",
      "source_hash": 7965958509288447947,
      "context_hash": 6566385506696719966,
      "translation": "epoll은 **커널에 상주하는 관심 목록**(interest list)을 사용합니다. 한 번 등록하면 다시 복사할 필요가 없습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating an epoll instance",
      "source_hash": 12487664459848955875,
      "context_hash": 13373872316208134607,
      "translation": "epoll 인스턴스 생성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Level-triggered vs edge-triggered",
      "source_hash": 5520091317672476353,
      "context_hash": 2993041877054990165,
      "translation": "레벨 트리거 대 에지 트리거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Level-triggered (LT) — default",
      "source_hash": 4210275225022636087,
      "context_hash": 8056674284229271884,
      "translation": "레벨 트리거(LT) — 기본값",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`epoll_wait` returns as long as the fd is ready:",
      "source_hash": 1834800706349472337,
      "context_hash": 6861963382165331318,
      "translation": "`epoll_wait`는 fd가 준비 상태인 동안 계속 반환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Safe: even if you don't drain the buffer in one call, you'll get notified again.",
      "source_hash": 6545333381435204427,
      "context_hash": 7045049141399637315,
      "translation": "안전함: 한 번의 호출로 버퍼를 모두 비우지 않더라도 다시 알림을 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Edge-triggered (ET)",
      "source_hash": 5866998961150453033,
      "context_hash": 12694099344779943359,
      "translation": "에지 트리거(ET)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`epoll_wait` returns only when the fd **transitions** from not-ready to ready:",
      "source_hash": 5620528301039346755,
      "context_hash": 6770867666926033017,
      "translation": "`epoll_wait`는 fd가 준비되지 않은 상태에서 준비된 상태로 **전환될** 때만 반환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "With EPOLLET you **must** read until `EAGAIN` in a non-blocking loop:",
      "source_hash": 6266302328732765219,
      "context_hash": 14654939492241162696,
      "translation": "EPOLLET을 사용할 때는 논블로킹 루프에서 `EAGAIN`이 나올 때까지 **반드시** 읽어야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "EPOLLONESHOT: single notification",
      "source_hash": 12195516264078900711,
      "context_hash": 14141913852430895849,
      "translation": "EPOLLONESHOT: 단일 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Receive one notification, then the fd is automatically disabled:",
      "source_hash": 5179770148615177643,
      "context_hash": 17968127456141052826,
      "translation": "알림을 한 번 받으면 해당 fd는 자동으로 비활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297965Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Useful for multi-threaded epoll where only one thread should handle each event.",
      "source_hash": 14166316055934826365,
      "context_hash": 6625733227337009761,
      "translation": "각 이벤트를 하나의 스레드만 처리해야 하는 멀티스레드 epoll에서 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel data structures",
      "source_hash": 6687612282138815230,
      "context_hash": 15022888385937265736,
      "translation": "커널 자료 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "data structures": "자료 구조",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "struct eventpoll",
      "source_hash": 12480087980844852645,
      "context_hash": 9884620019309003556,
      "translation": "struct eventpoll",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "struct epitem",
      "source_hash": 11482553917745221266,
      "context_hash": 13869484325621828329,
      "translation": "struct epitem",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "One `epitem` per monitored fd:",
      "source_hash": 5160762865071630876,
      "context_hash": 3633034126955795251,
      "translation": "감시 대상 fd마다 `epitem`이 하나씩 존재합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "ep_poll_callback: the critical wakeup path",
      "source_hash": 14051914372618427689,
      "context_hash": 16093545051325846354,
      "translation": "ep_poll_callback: 핵심 깨우기 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "When a monitored fd becomes ready, this callback runs from the fd's wait queue:",
      "source_hash": 6549796914303040925,
      "context_hash": 345639760427767914,
      "translation": "감시 대상 fd가 준비 상태가 되면 이 콜백이 해당 fd의 대기 큐(wait queue)에서 실행됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll_ctl(ADD) kernel path",
      "source_hash": 15838456795165613607,
      "context_hash": 11295684474829884724,
      "translation": "epoll_ctl(ADD) 커널 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Thundering herd and EPOLLEXCLUSIVE",
      "source_hash": 7065689959450404011,
      "context_hash": 14339088986627192033,
      "translation": "Thundering herd와 EPOLLEXCLUSIVE",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When many threads all `epoll_wait` on the same epfd and one event arrives, all threads wake up but only one handles it — **thundering herd**.",
      "source_hash": 3370697306782314693,
      "context_hash": 8202418770773580114,
      "translation": "여러 스레드가 모두 같은 epfd에서 `epoll_wait`를 호출하고 있을 때 이벤트 하나가 도착하면, 모든 스레드가 깨어나지만 그중 하나만 이벤트를 처리합니다. 이것이 **thundering herd**입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:36:37.297966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`EPOLLEXCLUSIVE` (4.5+) prevents this: only one waiter is woken per event:",
      "source_hash": 1311322575239160907,
      "context_hash": 1617130447716576309,
      "translation": "`EPOLLEXCLUSIVE`(4.5+)는 이를 방지합니다: 이벤트당 하나의 대기자만 깨어납니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Alternative: use separate epfds per thread, each with its own `accept()` thread on a `SO_REUSEPORT` socket:",
      "source_hash": 15550636371306542544,
      "context_hash": 14595545991630060282,
      "translation": "대안: 스레드마다 별도의 epfd를 사용하고, 각 스레드가 `SO_REUSEPORT` 소켓에서 자체 `accept()` 스레드를 갖도록 하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll with eventfd, signalfd, timerfd",
      "source_hash": 15895333099882167551,
      "context_hash": 4101871445191141554,
      "translation": "eventfd, signalfd, timerfd와 함께 쓰는 epoll",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll",
        "eventfd": "eventfd"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll works with any fd that implements `->poll`:",
      "source_hash": 17092415286468014027,
      "context_hash": 9487523232584274102,
      "translation": "epoll은 `->poll`을 구현하는 모든 fd와 함께 동작합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "All block on a single `epoll_wait`.",
      "source_hash": 6823732588393393457,
      "context_hash": 9070109123054836808,
      "translation": "모두 단일 `epoll_wait`에서 블록됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "No polling loop, no busy-waiting.",
      "source_hash": 5131559714446292294,
      "context_hash": 17807051769630442054,
      "translation": "폴링 루프도, busy-waiting도 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "epoll limitations",
      "source_hash": 2164322952430700558,
      "context_hash": 5583711370115306480,
      "translation": "epoll의 한계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Regular files**: always \"ready\" — cannot use epoll for disk file I/O (use io_uring)",
      "source_hash": 9277912544355273176,
      "context_hash": 13624157822306800809,
      "translation": "**일반 파일**: 항상 \"준비됨\" 상태이므로 디스크 파일 I/O에는 epoll을 사용할 수 없습니다(io_uring을 사용하십시오)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Directories**: not pollable",
      "source_hash": 5245803033223635544,
      "context_hash": 12906034722769550258,
      "translation": "**디렉터리**: poll할 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**No timeout per fd**: epoll_wait has one timeout for all",
      "source_hash": 9646935564578263604,
      "context_hash": 6294486942524689111,
      "translation": "**fd별 타임아웃 없음**: epoll_wait에는 모든 fd에 대해 하나의 타임아웃만 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Notification only**: epoll tells you a fd is ready but doesn't do the I/O (unlike io_uring)",
      "source_hash": 6903415916533213103,
      "context_hash": 8254731962607957055,
      "translation": "**알림 전용**: epoll은 fd가 준비되었음을 알려 줄 뿐 I/O를 수행하지는 않습니다(io_uring과 다른 점입니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245300Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing epoll",
      "source_hash": 891952705623577150,
      "context_hash": 14148441490664163641,
      "translation": "epoll 관찰하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:07.245300Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
